# lab_fire6 (Spec 11.33 fire D, copy of lab_na + side stills): 노 in the spell test scene - no save seed, no tutorial skip, no teleport. Rebuild the
# lab first (build, ~20 s; drop the line when the rig has not changed). 노 at the 6 m dummy, fx probe, 0.35x, 8 stills.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.35
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.10
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_0
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.10
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_1
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.10
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_2
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire6_2
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.15
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire6_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire6_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire6_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.60
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_6
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire6_6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1.00
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire6_7
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 2
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 2
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
